-0-0.png/60x60bb.jpg", "artworkUrl100": "https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/1b/86/9e/1b869e53-133a-e80e-7f20-513af4b19ef6/AppIconFull-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-0-0-7-0-0-sRGB-0-0-0-GLES2_U002c0-512MB-85-220-0-0.png/100x100bb.jpg", "sellerUrl": "http://www.worlduncovered.com", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "PL"], "fileSizeBytes": "49855488", "formattedPrice": "￦6,600", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3.66667, "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 3, "artistId": 480479527, "artistName": "Anawiki Games", "genres": ["여행", "라이프스타일"], "price": 6600.0, "releaseNotes": "Small bug fixes", "trackId": 1170448156, "trackName": "World Uncovered (Full)", "bundleId": "com.anawiki.worlddiscoveredfull", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "releaseDate": "2016-11-08T23:54:46Z", "sellerName": "Roman Budzowski", "primaryGenreName": "Travel", "primaryGenreId": 6003, "genreIds": ["6003", "6012"], "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2023-11-17T13:07:33Z", "version": "1.73", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "World Uncovered tracks your travels for you and maps them in vivid detail. It will show you where you’ve been, how fast and how high you were going, and how often you’ve returned to your favorite places. Can you walk every block in your city? Climb all the mountains in your area? How many countries have you visited? What landmarks have you seen? Find out, with World Uncovered.\n\n\nFeatures:\n- Record your travels using your phone or almost any other GPS-enabled device\n- 4 map display modes show you: where you've been; how fast you got there; how high it was; and how often you've revisited your favourite spots.\n- Speed map, height map and routes mode all present your travels in vivid colour\n- Score points and earn achievements: whether you're a beginner or an expert, we'll help you set goals and take your vacation game to the next level.\n- When you visit some of the world's most famous landmarks, you'll score bonus points, and keep a record of when you were there for posterity.\n- GPX and KML support: any GPS device using either of these standard formats is compatible with World Uncovered\n- Compete with your friends with Game Center integration\n- Fog of World user? You can import your data to World Uncovered and pick up where you left off\n- Battery efficient: We understand that charging opportunities are few and far between when you're on the go, so we've built our app with the goal of maximizing battery life.\n\nWorld Uncovered is a simple concept with the potential to go far. The world is yours to discover and our app is the perfect tool to help you do it, and make the experience even more fun. Start with a map that’s completely covered, and uncover locations by visiting them. Change up your routine and find ways of going places you’ve never been. Take a different route to work or school. Take a bike ride through the countryside. Travel. What better day to start the journey of a lifetime than today?\n\nTravel. Explore. Uncover!\n \nWhether you’re making a trip across town or across the ocean, World Uncovered will lead you to visit places you’ve never seen. The more you travel, the more your map begins to paint a picture of your life. Are you a wanderer or a creature of habit? A jet-setter or a mountain climber? Whatever your style of travel, World Uncovered will push you to reach new horizons and seek out new experiences.\n\nPlease note: Paid version is the same as free version of World Uncovered (that needs unlocking via In App Purchase), but paid version let's you take advantage of Family Sharing features of iOS.\n\nPlease note: This app may use your location even when it isn’t open, which can decrease device battery life.", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 3.66667, "trackCensoredName": "World Uncovered (Full)", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/world-uncovered-full/id1170448156?uo=4", "minimumOsVersion": "11.0", "userRatingCount": 3}]}